        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Given the highly regulated and global nature of our business, these processes are customized to each regulatory jurisdiction in which we operate, and are further tailored to client needs and preferences in specific countries in order to make it easier for clients in these countries to open accounts with us and then to fund and trade in those accounts.",
