        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If the retail client demands a product that has been assessed as inappropriate for the retail client’s circumstances by us, we may either refuse to offer the product to the client or allow them access to the product but we are required to give the retail client a warning that the product may be inappropriate to its circumstances.",
