        "filing_date": "2025-11-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In executing this strategy, we intend to both target new geographic locations and expand services offered in geographic locations in which we currently operate in an effort to increase our market share or where there is an unmet demand for our services.",
